WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.377
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.471
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:40.069
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:43.045
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, help me...my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.916
to see his smile

00:02:00.592 --> 00:02:08.556
THE COURAGE TO LOVE —
"I'VE DECIDED."

00:09:44.923 --> 00:09:47.255
MARMALADE BOY

00:09:53.665 --> 00:09:56.293
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.368 --> 00:22:12.392
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.558 --> 00:22:37.493
I'M HOME —
"HOW WILL I BE AROUND HIM?"

00:22:53.911 --> 00:22:58.439
I found the light

00:22:58.582 --> 00:23:03.815
That cleansed my heart

00:23:03.954 --> 00:23:08.550
In the awakening sky

00:23:08.692 --> 00:23:14.130
You shine

00:23:14.298 --> 00:23:19.235
Andl know

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.330
No matter how far
apart we may be

00:23:24.475 --> 00:23:29.344
We're greeting
the same dawn

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:34.850
Aren't we?

00:23:34.985 --> 00:23:39.615
It's the brightly
glittering thread

00:23:39.757 --> 00:23:45.059
That binds our memories

00:23:45.195 --> 00:23:50.258
In the future beyond futures

00:23:50.401 --> 00:23:55.429
The gods will be there for us

00:23:55.572 --> 00:24:01.841
The gods will be there for us
